---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout
  title="Loft Conversion Ely | Truleum Cambridgeshire Specialists"
  description="Expert loft conversion services in Ely, Cambridgeshire. Trusted local team for dormer, Velux and bespoke loft builds across Ely and surrounding Fenland villages."
>

  <main class="main-content area-ely-page" style="font-family: 'Poppins', Arial, sans-serif;">

    <style>
      .area-ely-page {
        --area-blue: #0a1a4a;
        --area-blue-2: #162b70;
        --area-gold: #d4af37;
        --area-soft: #f5f7fb;
        --area-text: #334155;
        overflow-x: hidden;
      }
      .area-wrap { width: min(1180px, calc(100% - 40px)); margin: 0 auto; }
      .area-ely-page section,
      .area-ely-page h1,
      .area-ely-page h2,
      .area-ely-page h3,
      .area-ely-page p,
      .area-ely-page img,
      .area-ely-page a { opacity: 1 !important; transform: none !important; }
      .area-hero { padding: 112px 0 96px; color: #fff; background: radial-gradient(circle at 85% 15%, rgba(212,175,55,0.24) 0%, rgba(212,175,55,0) 45%), linear-gradient(132deg, #08163d 0%, #0a1a4a 45%, #1c347f 100%); }
      .area-hero-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1.08fr 0.92fr; gap: 40px; align-items: center; }
      .area-kicker { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px; background: rgba(255,232,159,0.98); color: #0a1a4a; border-radius: 999px; padding: 10px 18px; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.6px; text-transform: uppercase; margin-bottom: 20px; }
      .area-hero h1 { font-size: clamp(36px, 5vw, 58px); line-height: 1.1; color: #fff; margin: 0 0 18px; max-width: 15ch; }
      .area-hero p { font-size: 18px; line-height: 1.8; color: rgba(255,255,255,0.92); margin: 0 0 26px; max-width: 60ch; }
      .area-hero-actions { display: flex; gap: 14px; flex-wrap: wrap; margin-bottom: 28px; }
      .area-btn { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px; text-decoration: none; border-radius: 999px; font-weight: 700; font-size: 15px; padding: 14px 24px; }
      .area-btn-primary { background: linear-gradient(135deg, #ffe89f 0%, #9f7628 100%); color: #111827; }
      .area-btn-ghost { color: #fff; border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.4); background: rgba(255,255,255,0.08); }
      .lc-metrics { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr)); gap: 16px; margin-top: 8px; }
      .lc-metric { background: rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.16); border-radius: 14px; padding: 16px; text-align: center; }
      .lc-metric strong { display: block; font-size: 24px; line-height: 1; color: #ffe89f; margin-bottom: 6px; }
      .lc-metric span { font-size: 13px; color: rgba(255,255,255,0.84); }
      .area-hero-card { background: rgba(255,255,255,0.11); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.16); border-radius: 20px; padding: 18px; backdrop-filter: blur(8px); }
      .area-hero-card img { width: 100%; border-radius: 12px; aspect-ratio: 4 / 3; object-fit: cover; }
      .area-price { margin-top: 14px; background: #fff; border-radius: 12px; padding: 12px 14px; color: #0a1a4a; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 600; }
      .area-price strong { color: #111827; font-size: 19px; }
      .area-section { padding: 86px 0; }
      .area-head { text-align: center; max-width: 830px; margin: 0 auto 34px; }
      .area-head h2 { color: var(--area-blue); font-size: clamp(30px, 4vw, 44px); line-height: 1.2; margin: 0 0 12px; }
      .area-head p { color: #475569; font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.8; margin: 0; }
      .area-intro { background: var(--area-soft); }
      .area-columns { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 26px; }
      .area-panel { background: #fff; border: 1px solid #e4e9f2; border-radius: 16px; padding: 24px; box-shadow: 0 10px 24px rgba(15,23,42,0.05); }
      .area-panel h3 { color: var(--area-blue); font-size: 24px; margin: 0 0 10px; }
      .area-panel p { color: var(--area-text); line-height: 1.8; margin: 0 0 14px; }
      .area-list { list-style: none; margin: 0; padding: 0; display: grid; gap: 9px; }
      .area-list li { display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 9px; color: #1f2937; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 15px; }
      .area-list i { color: var(--area-gold); margin-top: 3px; }
      .area-types-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr)); gap: 18px; }
      .area-type { border: 1px solid #e5e7eb; border-radius: 14px; background: #fff; padding: 20px; }
      .area-type h3 { font-size: 21px; color: var(--area-blue); margin: 0 0 8px; }
      .area-type p { margin: 0; color: var(--area-text); line-height: 1.75; font-size: 15px; }
      .area-zone { background: linear-gradient(180deg, #0a1a4a 0%, #102559 100%); }
      .area-zone .area-head h2, .area-zone .area-head p { color: #fff; }
      .area-zone-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(4, minmax(0, 1fr)); gap: 14px; }
      .area-zone-item { background: rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.15); border-radius: 12px; padding: 16px; }
      .area-zone-item h3 { color: #ffe89f; font-size: 20px; margin: 0 0 8px; }
      .area-zone-item h3 a { color: #ffe89f; text-decoration: none; }
      .area-zone-item h3 a:hover { text-decoration: underline; }
      .area-zone-item p { color: rgba(255,255,255,0.9); font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.7; margin: 0; }
      .area-proof-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(4, minmax(0, 1fr)); gap: 16px; }
      .area-proof { background: #fff; border: 1px solid #e5e7eb; border-radius: 14px; text-align: center; padding: 20px; }
      .area-proof i { color: var(--area-gold); font-size: 24px; margin-bottom: 10px; }
      .area-proof h3 { color: var(--area-blue); font-size: 18px; margin: 0 0 7px; }
      .area-proof p { margin: 0; color: #475569; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.7; }
      .area-faq { background: var(--area-soft); }
      .area-faq-grid { max-width: 920px; margin: 0 auto; display: grid; gap: 12px; }
      .area-faq-item { background: #fff; border: 1px solid #e5e7eb; border-radius: 12px; padding: 18px; }
      .area-faq-item h3 { color: var(--area-blue); margin: 0 0 8px; font-size: 19px; }
      .area-faq-item p { margin: 0; color: #334155; line-height: 1.75; font-size: 15px; }
      .area-cta { padding: 88px 0; text-align: center; background: linear-gradient(135deg, #0a1a4a 0%, #1f3a8a 100%); }
      .area-cta h2 { color: #fff; margin: 0 0 12px; font-size: clamp(30px, 4vw, 46px); }
      .area-cta p { color: rgba(255,255,255,0.9); max-width: 700px; margin: 0 auto 24px; line-height: 1.8; font-size: 17px; }
      @media (max-width: 1080px) { .area-types-grid { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr)); } .area-zone-grid { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr)); } .area-proof-grid { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr)); } }
      @media (max-width: 900px) { .area-hero { padding: 86px 0 70px; } .area-hero-grid, .area-columns { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } .area-hero h1 { max-width: 100%; } }
      @media (max-width: 680px) { .lc-metrics { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } .area-section, .area-cta { padding: 64px 0; } .area-types-grid, .area-zone-grid, .area-proof-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } .area-head p, .area-hero p, .area-cta p { font-size: 16px; } }
    </style>

    <section class="area-hero">
      <div class="area-wrap area-hero-grid">
        <div>
          <span class="area-kicker"><i class="fas fa-location-dot"></i> Ely, Cambridgeshire</span>
          <h1>Loft Conversion Ely Built For Local Homes</h1>
          <p>Looking for a reliable team for loft conversion in Ely? We design and build loft rooms for Ely homes, from Victorian terraces near the cathedral to modern estates across the city. Every project is tailored around your roof structure, planning context and how you want the space to work. See our full <a href="/services/loft-conversion-cambridge-service/" style="color:#ffe89f; font-weight:600;">Loft Conversion Service page</a> for everything we cover.</p>
          <div class="area-hero-actions">
            <a href="/contact/" class="area-btn area-btn-primary">Get Free Survey <i class="fas fa-arrow-right"></i></a>
            <a href="/gallery/" class="area-btn area-btn-ghost">View Our Work</a>
          </div>
          <div class="lc-metrics">
            <div class="lc-metric"><strong><i class="fas fa-check-circle"></i></strong><span>Free Site Survey</span></div>
            <div class="lc-metric"><strong><i class="fas fa-shield-alt"></i></strong><span>Fully Insured</span></div>
            <div class="lc-metric"><strong><i class="fas fa-award"></i></strong><span>Quality Assured</span></div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="area-hero-card">
          <img src="/wp-content/uploads/Loft-Conversion/loft-company-around-cambridge.webp" alt="Loft conversion in Ely Cambridgeshire by Truleum">
          <div class="area-price">
            <span>Typical project budget</span>
            <strong>From £28,000</strong>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="area-section area-intro">
      <div class="area-wrap">
        <div class="area-head">
          <h2>Local Approach For Every Loft Conversion In Ely</h2>
          <p>As a dedicated Cambridgeshire team, we plan each loft conversion in Ely around roof structure, planning rules and how you want the room to work day to day. Read our <a href="/loft-conversion-cambridge-guide-for-homeowners/" style="color: var(--area-blue); font-weight:600;">homeowner guide</a> for a full overview of the process.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="area-columns">
          <article class="area-panel">
            <h3>What You Get</h3>
            <p>Your Ely loft conversion includes design guidance, structural build, insulation, windows, electrics and high quality finishing throughout.</p>
            <ul class="area-list">
              <li><i class="fas fa-check-circle"></i> Clear scope and fixed stage pricing</li>
              <li><i class="fas fa-check-circle"></i> Strong communication from survey to handover</li>
              <li><i class="fas fa-check-circle"></i> Practical layouts for bedrooms, offices and suites</li>
              <li><i class="fas fa-check-circle"></i> Building control support throughout the project</li>
            </ul>
          </article>
          <article class="area-panel">
            <h3>Why Ely Homes Need Specialist Input</h3>
            <p>From Victorian terraces near the cathedral to newer Fenland estates, a successful loft conversion in Ely requires local knowledge of conservation rules, structural requirements and access. See the <a href="https://www.planningportal.co.uk/permission/common-projects/loft-conversion" target="_blank" rel="noopener nofollow">Planning Portal loft conversion rules</a> for formal guidance.</p>
            <ul class="area-list">
              <li><i class="fas fa-check-circle"></i> Experience with Ely conservation area requirements</li>
              <li><i class="fas fa-check-circle"></i> Design options to maximise head height in period roofs</li>
              <li><i class="fas fa-check-circle"></i> Smart staircase placement and storage planning</li>
              <li><i class="fas fa-check-circle"></i> Build sequencing to reduce household disruption</li>
            </ul>
          </article>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="area-section">
      <div class="area-wrap">
        <div class="area-head">
          <h2>Popular Loft Conversion Types For Ely Homes</h2>
          <p>We recommend the right type for your roof shape, budget and long term goals. Our <a href="/loft-conversion-glossary/" style="color: var(--area-blue); font-weight:600;">loft conversion glossary</a> explains all terms clearly.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="area-types-grid">
          <article class="area-type">
            <h3>Dormer Conversion</h3>
            <p>Most popular for Ely terraces and semis. Adds strong headroom and usable floor area for a bedroom, ensuite or home office.</p>
          </article>
          <article class="area-type">
            <h3>Velux Conversion</h3>
            <p>A lower impact option using roof windows. Ideal when you need extra space with minimal changes to the roofline, often permitted development.</p>
          </article>
          <article class="area-type">
            <h3>Hip To Gable</h3>
            <p>Works well for end of terrace and semi detached homes in Ely where extra width and better room proportions are the priority.</p>
          </article>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="area-section area-zone">
      <div class="area-wrap">
        <div class="area-head">
          <h2>Areas We Cover Around Ely</h2>
          <p>We deliver loft conversion services across Ely and the wider Fenland area with consistent quality and clear project management.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="area-zone-grid">
          <article class="area-zone-item"><h3>Ely City Centre</h3><p>Period terraces and Victorian semis near the cathedral with careful planning for conservation zones.</p></article>
          <article class="area-zone-item"><h3>Sutton and Haddenham</h3><p>Village homes and modern estates across the Fenland fringe west of Ely.</p></article>
          <article class="area-zone-item"><h3>Littleport and Witchford</h3><p>Growing communities north and south of Ely with a mix of older and newer housing stock.</p></article>
          <article class="area-zone-item"><h3><a href="/loft-conversion-soham/">Soham</a> and East Cambs</h3><p>East Cambridgeshire villages and market towns including Soham, Fordham and Burwell.</p></article>
          <article class="area-zone-item"><h3><a href="/loft-conversion-march-cambridgeshire/">March</a> and Fenland</h3><p>Serving the wider Fenland district including March, Chatteris and surrounding areas.</p></article>
          <article class="area-zone-item"><h3><a href="/loft-conversion-huntingdon/">Huntingdon</a> Area</h3><p>Covering Huntingdon and surrounding Cambridgeshire towns from our local base.</p></article>
          <article class="area-zone-item"><h3><a href="/loft-conversion-cambridge/">Cambridge</a></h3><p>Our core Cambridge coverage, including all city areas and surrounding villages.</p></article>
          <article class="area-zone-item"><h3><a href="/loft-conversion-wisbech/">Wisbech</a> and North Cambs</h3><p>Serving Wisbech and surrounding north Cambridgeshire communities.</p></article>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="area-section">
      <div class="area-wrap">
        <div class="area-head">
          <h2>Why Ely Homeowners Choose Truleum</h2>
          <p>Homeowners across Ely and Cambridgeshire choose us for reliable delivery, clear pricing and quality workmanship on every loft conversion project.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="area-proof-grid">
          <article class="area-proof"><i class="fas fa-map-marked-alt"></i><h3>Local Team</h3><p>Strong knowledge of Ely planning rules, roof types and conservation requirements.</p></article>
          <article class="area-proof"><i class="fas fa-file-signature"></i><h3>Transparent Quotes</h3><p>Clear inclusions and honest pricing with no hidden extras at any stage.</p></article>
          <article class="area-proof"><i class="fas fa-shield-alt"></i><h3>Fully Insured</h3><p>Professional project delivery with full insurance cover from start to finish.</p></article>
          <article class="area-proof"><i class="fas fa-award"></i><h3>Quality Finish</h3><p>Careful detailing at every stage so your new loft room feels complete and well built.</p></article>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="area-section area-faq">
      <div class="area-wrap">
        <div class="area-head">
          <h2>Ely Loft Conversion FAQs</h2>
          <p>Helpful answers for homeowners planning a loft conversion in Ely. Also see our full <a href="/loft-conversion-cost-cambridge/" style="color: var(--area-blue); font-weight:600;">cost guide</a> for detailed pricing information.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="area-faq-grid">
          <article class="area-faq-item">
            <h3>How much does a loft conversion in Ely cost?</h3>
            <p>Most loft conversion projects in Ely range from £28,000 to £65,000 depending on loft type, structural requirements and finishing specification. We provide a clear written quote after a free site survey.</p>
          </article>
          <article class="area-faq-item">
            <h3>Do I need planning permission for a loft conversion in Ely?</h3>
            <p>Many conversions in Ely fall under permitted development rights. Homes within conservation areas near the cathedral or with significant roof alterations may require full planning approval. We advise on this during the survey stage.</p>
          </article>
          <article class="area-faq-item">
            <h3>Can period homes near Ely cathedral have loft conversions?</h3>
            <p>Yes. Victorian and Edwardian properties can be excellent candidates, though conservation area rules may influence the design. We have experience managing these requirements while still creating a practical and well finished space.</p>
          </article>
          <article class="area-faq-item">
            <h3>How long does a loft conversion in Ely take?</h3>
            <p>A typical build runs from 6 to 10 weeks once work starts, depending on design complexity, structural requirements and the level of finish specified.</p>
          </article>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="area-cta">
      <div class="area-wrap">
        <p style="margin:0 0 12px; color: rgba(255,255,255,0.82);">Useful links: <a href="/loft-conversion-glossary/" style="color:#ffe89f; font-weight:600;">Loft Conversion Glossary</a> | <a href="/loft-conversion-cost-cambridge/" style="color:#ffe89f; font-weight:600;">Cost Guide</a> | <a href="/loft-conversion-cambridge-guide-for-homeowners/" style="color:#ffe89f; font-weight:600;">Homeowner Guide</a> | <a href="/loft-conversion-cambridge/" style="color:#ffe89f; font-weight:600;">Cambridge Area Page</a></p>
        <h2>Plan Your Ely Loft Conversion Today</h2>
        <p>Book a free consultation to discuss layout ideas, timeline and cost. We will help you create extra space that works for your Ely home.</p>
        <a href="/contact/" class="area-btn area-btn-primary">Book Free Consultation <i class="fas fa-calendar-check"></i></a>
      </div>
    </section>

    <script type="application/ld+json">
    {
      "@context": "https://schema.org",
      "@type": "FAQPage",
      "mainEntity": [
        {
          "@type": "Question",
          "name": "How much does a loft conversion in Ely cost?",
          "acceptedAnswer": {
            "@type": "Answer",
            "text": "Most loft conversion projects in Ely range from £28,000 to £65,000 depending on loft type, structural requirements and finishing specification."
          }
        },
        {
          "@type": "Question",
          "name": "Do I need planning permission for a loft conversion in Ely?",
          "acceptedAnswer": {
            "@type": "Answer",
            "text": "Many conversions in Ely fall under permitted development. Homes in conservation areas near the cathedral or with major roof changes may need full planning approval."
          }
        },
        {
          "@type": "Question",
          "name": "Can period homes near Ely cathedral have loft conversions?",
          "acceptedAnswer": {
            "@type": "Answer",
            "text": "Yes. Victorian and Edwardian properties can be strong candidates for loft conversion, though conservation area rules may shape the design approach."
          }
        },
        {
          "@type": "Question",
          "name": "How long does a loft conversion in Ely take?",
          "acceptedAnswer": {
            "@type": "Answer",
            "text": "A typical loft conversion in Ely takes 6 to 10 weeks from build start, depending on complexity and specification."
          }
        }
      ]
    }
    </script>

  </main>
</BaseLayout>
